{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the object is visible, approach it. Then grab it, move it, check properties and execute specific task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
